Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.60,0:22:41.70,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\move(250.7,58,259.7,67,4700,5100)\t(4700,5100,2.4,\fscx105\fscy105\frz1)\fad(150,400)\blur3\bord1}宇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.62,0:22:41.72,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\move(289,58,276,70,4700,5100)\t(4700,5100,2,\fscx106\fscy106\frz13)\fad(150,400)\blur3\bord1}宙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.64,0:22:41.74,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\move(327.3,58,311.3,39,4700,5100)\t(4700,5100,2.5,\fscx101\fscy101\frz-22)\fad(150,400)\blur3\bord1}微
